      "ArticleTitle": "[THE INCONSISTENCIES OF REGULATION OF METABOLISM IN PHYLOGENESIS AT THREE LEVELS OF \"RELATIVE BIOLOGICAL PERFECTION\": ETIOLOGY OF METABOLIC PANDEMICS].",
